# Protos copied from contracts/ into each service module for local `mvn`/
# `uv` runs outside Docker (the Containerfiles do the same copy inside the
# build context — see quarkus/Containerfile and python/Containerfile).
# contracts/proto/ stays the single source of truth; these copies are
# build-time-only and never committed.
